10→    "rungVocabulary": "No new rung token is introduced. `observed` is already the registered rung of the native `unresolved-edge` relation, and an import carries exactly one strength of claim: the observation was made. Window, population, observability and completeness are carried by the payload and the closed-world machinery, never by the rung.",
